    {
      "name": "a-standalone-emulator-the-packaged-table-does-not-cover-refuses",
      "rationale": "Standalone entries are not refused as a class — the vectors below answer several. This one is refused because nothing establishes where THIS emulator reads packs, and the entry route says so with the standalone code rather than naming a directory nobody read.",
      "input": {
